ealine?\", \"open tasks?\", \"fourth one to wednesday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0008\", \"v\": [[\"whats in my calendar saturday\", \"ok move both of them to saturday pls\", \"diff thing, can u look up Hendan Vrellova\"], [\"saturday calendar?\", \"move both to saturday\", \"look up Hendan Vrellova\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0009\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to get a sense of how busy things are going to be, so how many tasks have I got due next week?\", \"Actually, scrap that — I'll have a look later myself when I've got a minute, no need.\"], [\"umm how many tasks are… are due next week?\", \"oh, actually, no, scrap that, I'll just check it later myself\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0010\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when my glove thing is, please?\", \"Separately, would you mind showing me which expenses were over forty euros?\", \"Could you narrow that to only the ones more than eighty euros, please?\", \"On another matter, could you tell me which tasks are still open?\"], [\"I've completely lost track of it and it's bugging me, so when is my glove thing again?\", \"Different thing — I'm trying to get a handle on where the money's gone lately, so which expenses were over forty euros?\", \"Hmm, that's still more than I want to wade through right now, so just show me the ones more than eighty euros.\", \"Okay, switching over to the to-do side of things before I forget, which tasks are still open for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0011\", \"v\": [[\"what glove stuff have i got\", \"wait quick one, what do the Kingsbridge expenses add up to\", \"ok back to the glove stuff, whos coming to the first one\"], [\"Could you show me what glove things I have, please?\", \"Sorry, just before I forget — could you tell me what the Kingsbridge expenses add up to?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the glove items, could you tell me who's coming to the first one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0012\", \"v\": [[\"show me everything mentioning Teodor\", \"can u make the bassoon one an hour later\"], [\"ok so can you pull up… everything that mentions Teodor?\", \"umm and the bassoon one, could you push that, like, an hour later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0013\", \"v\": [[\"got any pics of Teodor? wanna see them\"], [\"Could you please show me the photos of Teodor?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when I'm next seeing Doleth Summerfield, please?\", \"Would you mind telling me who else will be there?\", \"Do I happen to have a photo of any of them?\"], [\"umm when am I next seeing… Doleth Summerfield?\", \"ok and who else is gonna be there?\", \"hmm do I have, like, a photo of any of them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0015\", \"v\": [[\"uh can you pull up the turret fund expenses that are, um, above thirty five?\", \"ok and how many's… how many is that?\"], [\"We're trying to figure out where the kitty's gone, so could you show me the turret fund expenses above thirty five?\", \"Right, I just need a count for when I message the group, so how many is that altogether?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0016\", \"v\": [[\"I need to check the details on the account before I update anything, so could you pull up the garage portal entry in the locker? Just the entry, not the password itself.\"], [\"garage portal locker entry\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0017\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's the actual, like, the garage portal password?\", \"oh and, uh, did I delete the waterlily photo or…?\"], [\"garage portal password?\", \"waterlily photo deleted?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0018\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what's in my Arequipa trip folder, please?\", \"Thank you. And Bills?\"], [\"I'm tidying up my documents this afternoon and can't remember what I put where, so what's in my Arequipa trip folder?\", \"Okay, that helps a lot. And Bills? Same question for that one, since I suspect it's a mess too.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0019\", \"v\": [[\"mark the bollard to-do done\", \"no wrong task, i meant the lend one\", \"show me pics of Shythir\", \"add a task to call the marsh photo next monday\", \"when do i have the soapmaking\", \"and the shovel?\"], [\"ok can you mark the, um, the bollard to-do as done?\", \"no wait, that's the wrong task, I meant the lend one\", \"umm different thing, can you show me photos of Shythir?\", \"ok so add a task to… call the marsh photo next monday\", \"oh and when do I have the soapmaking?\", \"and the shovel?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0020\", \"v\": [[\"spending last week?\", \"squash shots\", \"what about Vesna?\"], [\"I've been trying to keep an eye on money lately, so what did my spending come to last week?\", \"Totally unrelated, but I was telling someone about our games the other day, can you find my shots about squash?\", \"Oh nice, that's the one. What about Vesna? I'd love to dig up some of those too.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0023\", \"v\": [[\"delete Seren note\", \"which task's an hour?\"], [\"pls delete the Seren note\", \"which task is like an hour job roughly\"]]}","ttft_ms":8829,"type":"result","duration_ms":25531,"uuid":"525906bd-bfe8-4971-8e3a-49c168fbc4cc","ttft_stream_ms":1405,"time_to_request_ms":137,"first_content_frame_ms":1406,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21884501,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278434664.99,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
